{{!
    @template mod_tarsuscoach/usage_bar

    A horizontal bar of the AI credits used against the limit, coloured by
    how close the limit is, with marks at 50, 75 and 90 %.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * level - How close the limit is: ok, warning, critical or exhausted.
    * label - The figures in words.
    * width - How full the bar is, in percent (a number with a dot).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "level": "ok",
        "label": "120 of 1,000 AI credits used (12 %)",
        "width": "12.0"
    }
}}
<div class="tarsus-usage tarsus-usage--{{level}}" role="img" aria-label="{{label}}">
    <div class="tarsus-usage__track"><span class="tarsus-usage__fill" style="width:{{width}}%"></span><i class="tarsus-usage__mark" style="left:50%"></i><i class="tarsus-usage__mark" style="left:75%"></i><i class="tarsus-usage__mark" style="left:90%"></i></div>
    <div class="tarsus-usage__label">{{label}}</div>
</div>
